        "text_HjYXyW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>But in trying to eat less, I had also started eating less fiber. There were fewer whole grains. Smaller portions of fruit. More quick, protein-focused meals that looked healthy but didn’t always give my gut what it needed.</p>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
