          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>💡 Enough fiber a day supports stool bulk, bowel regularity, digestive function, and the beneficial bacteria living in the gut. When daily fiber intake falls short you <strong>start to feel that your waist increases and you've gained weight almost through the day. </strong></p>",
            "background_color": "#f8e3e8",
