            "font_size": 40,
            "font_size_mobile": 26,
            "font_weight": "700",
            "line_height": 1.2,
            "margin_bottom": 10
          }
        },
        "text_JpWUji": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I had been searching for ways to lose weight and started to feel lighter inside:</p>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "font_weight": "400",
            "line_height": 1.2,
            "margin_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_jLWgiM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Less food.<br/>Fewer carbs.<br/>No dessert.<br/>No restaurant meals</p>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "font_weight": "400",
            "line_height": 1.4,
            "margin_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_8cHJgj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>But restriction wasn’t solving the reason I felt uncomfortable.<br/></strong>In fact, eating less sometimes made it harder to get enough fiber and maintain a consistent digestive routine.</p>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "font_weight": "400",
            "line_height": 1.4,
            "margin_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_4xBrap": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>So instead of asking:<br/><strong>“What else should I stop eating?”</strong></p>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "font_weight": "400",
            "line_height": 1.4,
            "margin_bottom": 10
          }
        },
        "text_f9qrcQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>So instead of asking:<br/><strong>“What is my gut missing?”</strong></p>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "font_weight": "400",
            "line_height": 1.4,
            "margin_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_KF3EqG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>That shift changed everything.</p>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "font_weight": "400",
            "line_height": 1.4,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
