        "text_ji6BJq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>My digestion felt more predictable</li><li>I stopped carrying the same uncomfortable heaviness</li><li>My stomach didn’t feel as dramatically different by evening</li></ul>",
            "color": "#111111",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "font_weight": "400",
            "line_height": 1.4,
            "margin_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_h6jHbd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>And one day, I put on my jeans without immediately wondering when I would need to unbutton them.<br/>That small moment gave me more confidence than another restrictive diet I ever had.</p>",
